nally controlling real-time symbolic music generation through embodied motion from another artistic modality. Second, we introduce a live performance that extends calligraphy beyond a primarily visual art into a multimodal artistic experience. We will release the code and a video demo upon publication. 2. Background 2.1. Background of Calligraphy In Chinese and broader East Asian contexts, calligraphy is commonly understood as a form of visual art that uses written characters as its medium britannica_chinese_calligraphy . I", "stderr": "\nShell cwd was reset to /inspire/qb-ilm/project/video-generation/chenxie-25019/hyr/iHateTheWorld555.github.io", "interrupted": false, "isImage": false, "noOutputExpected": false}}
