{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "chatcmpl-tool-bf454b639245e446", "type": "tool_result", "content": "# InstructAudio: Unified speech and music generation with natural language instruction\narXiv: 2511.18487\nAuthors: Chunyu Qiang, Kang Yin, Xiaopeng Wang, Yuzhe Liang, Jiahui Zhao, Ruibo Fu, Tianrui Wang, Cheng Gong, Chen Zhang, Longbiao Wang, Jianwu Dang\nYear: 2025 | Venue: \nTopic: tts_vc\nStatus: unread\n\nContributions:\n  1. We introduce a joint modeling framework for speech and music generation based on a multimodal diffusion transformer architecture.\n  2. We achieve unified text-based control over speech and music generation through a standardized instruction-phoneme input format encompassing timbre, paralinguistic, and musical attributes while supporting dialogue generation.\n  3. Experimental results demonstrate state-of-the-art performance in instruction-based text-to-speech while maintaining competitive text-to-music capabilities.\n\nTags: TTS, TTS/架构-NAR-Flow, TTS/控制-NL描述, TTS/控制-指令合成, 压缩, 压缩/量化-VAE", "is_error": false}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "94617284-9e36-4b09-bacc-930f3120c1c0", "uuid": "4e1dd219-59d4-4de5-99a7-842b2875f7d6", "timestamp": "2026-08-05T06:55:22.163Z", "tool_use_result": {"stdout": "# InstructAudio: Unified speech and music generation with natural language instruction\narXiv: 2511.18487\nAuthors: Chunyu Qiang, Kang Yin, Xiaopeng Wang, Yuzhe Liang, Jiahui Zhao, Ruibo Fu, Tianrui Wang, Cheng Gong, Chen Zhang, Longbiao Wang, Jianwu Dang\nYear: 2025 | Venue: \nTopic: tts_vc\nStatus: unread\n\nContributions:\n  1. We introduce a joint modeling framework for speech and music generation based on a multimodal diffusion transformer architecture.\n  2. We achieve unified text-based control over speech and music generation through a standardized instruction-phoneme input format encompassing timbre, paralinguistic, and musical attributes while supporting dialogue generation.\n  3. Experimental results demonstrate state-of-the-art performance in instruction-based text-to-speech while maintaining competitive text-to-music capabilities.\n\nTags: TTS, TTS/架构-NAR-Flow, TTS/控制-NL描述, TTS/控制-指令合成, 压缩, 压缩/量化-VAE", "stderr": "", "interrupted": false, "isImage": false, "noOutputExpected": false}}
